@startuml student-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (student-service) - FR-01\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IStudentProfile <<provided>> {
  +createProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +updateProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +getProfile(studentId): Profile
  +getAvailability(studentId): List<TimeSlot>
}

class StudentProfileService <<component>> {
  -repository: IProfileRepository
  -profileValidator: ProfileValidator
  --
  +createProfile(...) / updateProfile(...)
  +getProfile(...) / getAvailability(...)
}

IStudentProfile <|.. StudentProfileService
class ProfileValidator <<component>> {
  +validate(data): ValidationResult
  +isValidSlot(slot): boolean
}
StudentProfileService --> ProfileValidator

interface IProfileRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Profile): void
  +findById(id): Profile
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Profile>
}

StudentProfileService --> IProfileRepository
class Profile {
  -studentId: String
  -academicLevel: String
  -major: String
  -interests: List<String>
  -careerInterests: List<String>
  --
  +isComplete(): boolean
}
class TimeSlot {
  -day: String
  -start: Time
  -end: Time
}
IProfileRepository --> Profile
Profile *-- "1..*" TimeSlot : availability
note bottom of StudentProfileService
SOLID applied:
S - StudentProfileService only coordinates; ProfileValidator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing StudentProfileService.
L - StudentProfileService can replace any other IStudentProfile implementation.
I - IStudentProfile has only the operations its clients use.
D - StudentProfileService depends on interfaces (IProfileRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
